{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":1210,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Firework Buff"]}," is a buff that gives the tower a chance to fire a firework at an enemy. It appears in the tower's upgrade menu, specifically the top left part of the preview."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwCA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Mechanics"},"children":["Mechanics"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["This buff is activated upon enemy receiving damage from a tower with their main attack, in most cases this will give it a chance to activate it, though some towers can never activate it. There is a chance that the buff will activate itself, which is determined using the ",{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["Firework Shot Chance Cap"]}," value from the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Firework Buff"]}," giver and the ",{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["Firerate"]}," statistic of the tower the firework is fired from. A tower has a chance to create a firework for each enemy hit, meaning that towers which can hit multiple enemies, like the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Hallow_Punk","title":"Hallow Punk"},"children":["Hallow Punk"]}," or ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Electroshocker","title":"Electroshocker"},"children":["Electroshocker"]},", are capable of generating multiple fireworks at once. "]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The chance is calculated as:"]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Firework Shot Chance Cap","1","+","2.71","8","(","−","0.5","×","(","F","i","r","e","r","a","t","e","−","6",")",")"]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["where ",{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["Firework Shot Chance Cap"]}," is taken from the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Firework_Technician","title":"Firework Technician"},"children":["Firework Technician"]},", and ",{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["Firerate"]}," is taken from the tower that fires out the firework. Firerate in this case is the statistic displayed with the hour glass to the right of the tower. In most cases, this is the firerate statistic (time between each shot), though in some cases it may be the burst cooldown (time between bursts), like the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Elementalist","title":"Elementalist"},"children":["Elementalist"]},", the spawnrate, like the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Military_Base","title":"Military Base"},"children":["Military Base"]}," or just unrelated to any statistic it has, such as the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Trapper","title":"Trapper"},"children":["Trapper"]},"."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Multiple towers are not affected by this buff, while some can create multiple fireworks. A full list of towers affected fully, partially or that are unaffected can be found below. Only accounts for the main attack and units."]},"\n",{"type":"table","props":{"id":"mwGg"},"children":["\n",{"type":"tbody","props":{},"children":[{"type":"tr","props":{},"children":[{"type":"th","props":{"colSpan":3},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Firework_Buff"},"children":["Firework Buff"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"tr","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"th","props":{},"children":["Tower"]},"\n",{"type":"th","props":{},"children":["Status"]},"\n",{"type":"th","props":{},"children":["Firework Amount"]}]},"\n",{"type":"tr","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"td","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Scout","title":"Scout"},"children":["Scout"]}]},"\n",{"type":"td","props":{},"children":["Affected"]},"\n",{"type":"td","props":{},"children":["Single"]}]},"\n",{"type":"tr","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"td","props":{},"children"